BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 380.9 Tm (6. Rest days: the Helper has 2 rest days per month, which the Employer chooses. Other rest days) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88 366.4 Tm (are paid at the daily rate if the Helper works.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 343.2 Tm (7. Statutory holidays and leave: the Helper receives statutory holidays and paid annual leave only if) Tj ET
